# DOC CAI NAY TRUOC: FILE NAY HIEN KHONG CHAN GI CA
#
# CODEOWNERS chi la mot loi MOI nguoi review. No tro thanh mot phep chan
# khi VA CHI KHI ca ba dieu duoi day dung:
#
#   1. Nhanh dich co branch protection, va bat "Require review from Code
#      Owners".
#   2. Thay doi di qua PULL REQUEST. Push truc tiep vao nhanh thi
#      CODEOWNERS khong chay.
#   3. Nguoi/doi duoi day co that trong to chuc GitHub nay.
#
# HOM NAY KHONG DIEU NAO DUNG. `git log --merges` chi co merge tu-nhanh,
# chua co PR nao; va code di len CodeCommit bang `git push codecommit
# HEAD:main`, tuc PUSH TRUC TIEP vao main.
#
# Dieu do quan trong hon mot file cau hinh, vi ops-pipeline/main.tf viet
# rang no KHONG can cong duyet trong pipeline, va ly do neu ra la:
#
#     "cho duyet dung la PR tren git, khong phai mot cong trong CodeBuild
#      noi nguoi ta bam tu dien thoai"
#
# Lop bu do CHUA TON TAI. Nen hien tai mot thay doi SCP di tu may nguoi
# viet den AWS ma khong ai khac doc - ba lop kiem tu dong (Lint, gate.py,
# FAIL_ON_DESTROY) deu khong phai NGUOI, va khong lop nao trong so do
# doc duoc y DINH.
#
# =========================================================================
# PHAI LAM GI DE NO THANH THAT
#
#   1. Doi @TEN-TO-CHUC/doi-bao-mat duoi day thanh handle THAT.
#      KHONG doan ten doi - lay tu GitHub, roi kiem bang cach mo mot PR
#      thu va xem GitHub co tu gan reviewer khong.
#   2. GitHub > Settings > Branches > nhanh chinh:
#        - Require a pull request before merging
#        - Require review from Code Owners
#   3. Doi cach day len CodeCommit: pipeline nghe nhanh main cua
#      CodeCommit, nen chung nao con `git push codecommit HEAD:main` thi
#      buoc 1-2 chi bao ve repo GitHub, khong bao ve duong chay that.
#
# Buoc 3 la buoc de bo qua nhat va la buoc duy nhat quan trong.
#
# =========================================================================
# VI SAO NHUNG DUONG DAN NAY, KHONG CHI catalog
#
# Doi ban dau la "sec duyet rule". Nhung "rule" khong chi nam trong
# catalog:
#
#   scp.yaml          noi dung rule
#   scp-catalog.tf    thu RENDER rule do. Doi mot builder condition o day
#                     la doi Y NGHIA cua rule ma catalog khong doi mot ky
#                     tu - va dau file lint.sh tu thua nhan no KHONG bat
#                     duoc truong hop nay.
#   lint.sh           bo phan loai THAT/NOI. Noi long chinh no la noi
#                     long moi rule cung mot luc.
#   ops-gate/gate.py  bang LUAT la chinh sach an ninh o dang code: "tao
#                     mot assignment la noi". Mot dong o day quyet dinh
#                     thay doi nao di qua duoc.
#   ops-loosen.yaml   khai bao noi long CO CHU DICH. Chinh la thu can
#                     nguoi duyet nhat.
#
# Duyet catalog ma khong duyet bon file kia la duyet cai de nhat.

